{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27240","headline":"省试骐骥长鸣 · 章孝标","name":"省试骐骥长鸣","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"有马骨堪惊，无人眼暂明。\n力穷吴坂峻，嘶苦朔风生。\n逐逐怀良御，萧萧顾乐鸣。\n瑶池期弄影，天路拟飞声。\n皎月谁知种，浮云莫问程。\n盐车今愿脱，千里爲君行。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"章孝标","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27240.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27240","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}